<!--
  ZA.Outbox v4.0.0 - intentional API breaks for the major version bump.

  The v1.x DI extension aliases have been [Obsolete] since 2.0 under ZAOBOX002 to ZAOBOX006, and
  4.0 removes them, together with the explicit serializer choice of #207. Each removal has a
  direct replacement on the IOutboxBuilder that AddOutbox() returns; docs/migrating-to-v4.md maps
  every old name to its replacement. The generated ZAOBOX010 alias is emitted into consumer
  assemblies, so it has no entry here.

  Generated by apicompat in suppression-file mode against the 3.0.1 baseline of each package,
  then annotated. The 3.0 entries for #191 and #198 were dropped: against the 3.0.1 baseline they
  are unnecessary. Only the removed aliases are listed, so an accidental removal elsewhere still
  fails the job.
-->
